Subject: Time direct calls at instruction boundaries

Extend selected native instruction timing to ordinary JSR/JSL and immediate
ORA. Commit call clocks before transfer, yield missing callees to the owning
interpreter, and preserve the resume bank across JSL deadline unwinds.
Add real interpreter comparisons for complete and suspended executions.

Co-authored-by: Codex <codex@openai.com>

